config RUST_UMH
	bool "Rust usermode-helper source proposal (not admitted)"
	depends on RUST && BROKEN
	default n
	help
	  Inactive continuation of the existing usermode-helper Rust owner.
	  Native ABI/CFI, initialization, completion/wait lifetimes, configured
	  policy and original-test qualification remain open. Keep disabled.
